snowflake-arctic-embed-s-weights

This product converts and distributes model weights derived from Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-s
(https://huggingface.co/Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-s), Copyright Snowflake Inc.,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

model.ae8 contains Int8-quantized (SmoothQuant, alpha = 0.40) weights converted deterministically
from the original FP32 checkpoint. vocab.txt is redistributed unmodified.
